<!--
  English source strings of the iPhone UI. docs/LOCALIZATION_GLOSSARY.md gives the terms.
  Each comment says where the text shows, what each placeholder means, and the maximum length where space is tight.
  A "Max N characters." limit counts the text after the placeholders are filled in.
-->
